<title>MEXICO: Mexico's March average crude oil prices by type.</title>
<headline>Mexico's March average crude oil prices by type.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex)'s trading arm updated average crude oil prices for March on Monday.</p>
<p>Below follows a comparative table of prices in dollars per barrel, by type and region exported.</p>
<p>    Type		 March 97	   Feb. 97</p>
<p>America</p>
<p>    Maya		    14.89	     15.67</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 18.33	     20.09</p>
<p>    Olmeca		  19.79	     21.58</p>
<p>Europe</p>
<p>    Maya		    13.31*	    14.39</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 17.22*	    18.48</p>
<p>Far East</p>
<p>    Maya		    15.23	     15.91</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 19.13	     19.86</p>
<p>*Final prices not available and will be determined April 17.</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
